#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid ""
"Choose a group declared on one or more endpoints with the RateLimitGroup "
"attribute or WithRateLimitGroups()."
msgstr "选择由一个或多个终结点通过 RateLimitGroup 属性或 WithRateLimitGroups() 声明的分组。"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid ""
"Global applies everywhere, Endpoint matches a request path prefix, and Group"
" matches endpoints assigned to a named rate-limit group."
msgstr "全局适用于所有请求；终结点匹配请求路径前缀；分组匹配已分配到指定速率限制分组的终结点。"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid ""
"Matches requests that start with this path, for example '/api/' or "
"'/users/login'."
msgstr "匹配以此前路径开头的请求，例如 '/api/' 或 '/users/login'。"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid "Optionally describe what this policy is intended to protect."
msgstr "可以描述此策略用于保护的对象。"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid "Policy name"
msgstr "策略名称"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid "Policy type"
msgstr "策略类型"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid "Rate-limit group"
msgstr "速率限制分组"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid "Request path"
msgstr "请求路径"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid ""
"The group target is read-only while this policy is enabled. Disable it first"
" to choose a different group."
msgstr "策略启用期间，分组目标为只读。请先禁用策略，再选择其他分组。"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid ""
"The policy type is read-only while this policy is enabled. Disable it first "
"to retarget the policy."
msgstr "策略启用期间，策略类型为只读。请先禁用策略，再重新设置策略目标。"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid ""
"The request path is read-only while this policy is enabled. Disable it first"
" to change endpoint targeting."
msgstr "策略启用期间，请求路径为只读。请先禁用策略，再更改终结点目标。"

#: Views/Admin/RateLimitPolicy.Fields.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.Admin.RateLimitPolicy.Fields"
msgid "Use a unique name to identify this tenant policy."
msgstr "使用唯一名称来标识此租户策略。"

#: Views/ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit"
msgid ""
"Choose whether waiting requests are handled in arrival order or whether the "
"newest waiting request gets the next free slot first."
msgstr "选择等待中的请求是按到达顺序处理，还是让最新的等待请求优先获得下一个空闲槽位。"

#: Views/ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit"
msgid ""
"How many extra requests can wait for a free slot while all running slots are"
" busy. Use 0 to reject extras immediately."
msgstr "所有运行槽位均繁忙时，可有多少额外请求等待空闲槽位。使用 0 会立即拒绝额外请求。"

#: Views/ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit"
msgid ""
"How many matching requests can run at the same time. For example, 3 means a "
"fourth request must wait or be rejected."
msgstr "最多可同时运行多少个匹配请求。例如，设置为 3 时，第 4 个请求必须等待或被拒绝。"

#: Views/ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit"
msgid "Permit limit"
msgstr "许可上限"

#: Views/ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit"
msgid "Queue limit"
msgstr "队列上限"

#: Views/ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.ConcurrencyRateLimiter.Edit"
msgid "Queue processing order"
msgstr "队列处理顺序"

#: Views/FixedWindowRateLimiter.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.FixedWindowRateLimiter.Edit"
msgid ""
"How long one window lasts. For example, 60 means the count resets every "
"minute."
msgstr "一个窗口持续多长时间。例如，60 表示每分钟重置一次计数。"

#: Views/FixedWindowRateLimiter.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.RateLimits.Views.FixedWindowRateLimiter.Edit"
msgid ""
"How many extra requests can wait after the limit is reached. Use 0 to reject"
" extras immediately instead of making them wait."
